OL,3,GNEWSAHistoric plane to fly again after
OL,4,Aair show crash
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn historic plane that crashed during
OL,7,Fan air display is set to be restored
OL,8,Fand flown once more.
OL,10,FThe de Havilland DH.88 Comet got into
OL,11,Fdifficulty as its pilot tried to land
OL,12,Fduring a "flying proms" air show at
OL,13,FShuttleworth, Bedfordshire, on
OL,14,FSaturday.
OL,16,FThe pilot was taken to hospital and
OL,17,Fdischarged the next day.
OL,19,FThe Shuttleworth Trust said its
OL,20,Fintention was to "rebuild the aircraft
OL,21,Fto airworthy condition".
